  // ── Part 2: simulate the TOCTOU window at the raw level ──

  // ── Part 3: end-to-end via the SetVisibility public API ──

A codebase-wide search for U+2500 (─) returns zero matches outside these three lines — the dividers are unique to AI-generated code in this PR. The established house style uses plain inline comments (e.g., '// Non-owner denied.' / '// Absent id → ok (caller will create).') with no decorative unicode framing.

Suggested fix: replace with plain comments. E.g.:

